{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不要再去翻这些旧账  (Stop Digging Up Those Old Scores)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outraged by Luo Lin's televised slanders against his friend, veteran host Wen Simo marches into Xingtian demanding Chun Yuqiao's approval to confront Luo Lin live on his talk show. Listen to Wen Simo, Chun Yuqiao, and Xingzi in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "签个字，这是下一期闻娱论，我要让洛琳上这个节目跟她好好聊一聊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "凭着我五千个小时的主播生涯，我一定让这个满嘴谎话的女人当场现出原形！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你回来！现在不行，不要把这些事情扩大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你就愿意顶着这身脏水被黑一辈子？你还有没有原则了，你怕什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你听我说，不能让这件事情再扩大，不要再去翻这些旧账。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻思默，我求你了行吗？我不是真的不能面对过去，那些陈年烂事可以挖。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是我拜托你不要是现在，不要是我跟惠美的这个时候，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我越界了。事关你们的私事，应该你们自己去处理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你和惠美的个性都很强，我相信你们自己能处理好。记得吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "闻老师，您提的这个建议特别好，但是不管发生什么事，老大都不希望更多的人知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "听你们老大的吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我不明白，为什么老大能救我们一百次，而我们连一次都救不了他。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "签个字，这是下一期闻娱论，我要让洛琳上这个节目跟她好好聊一聊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sign right here — for the next episode of my talk show, I'm bringing Luo Lin on air for a proper chat!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "凭着我五千个小时的主播生涯，我一定让这个满嘴谎话的女人当场现出原形！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With five thousand hours as a live host behind me, I will expose that lying woman's true colors right on camera!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你回来！现在不行，不要把这些事情扩大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come back here! Not right now — don't blow this matter up any further.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你就愿意顶着这身脏水被黑一辈子？你还有没有原则了，你怕什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you willing to wear this filthy slander for the rest of your life? Where are your principles — what are you afraid of?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你听我说，不能让这件事情再扩大，不要再去翻这些旧账。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen to me: we cannot let this blow up further, and stop digging up those old scores.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻思默，我求你了行吗？我不是真的不能面对过去，那些陈年烂事可以挖。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wen Simo, I'm begging you, alright? It isn't that I can't face the past — you could dig up all that old mess.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是我拜托你不要是现在，不要是我跟惠美的这个时候，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just please, I beg you, not right now — not at this fragile moment between Huimei and me, okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我越界了。事关你们的私事，应该你们自己去处理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I overstepped. This touches on your private life, so the two of you should handle it yourselves.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你和惠美的个性都很强，我相信你们自己能处理好。记得吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both you and Huimei have strong personalities, and I trust you'll work things out. Remember to take your stomach medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "闻老师，您提的这个建议特别好，但是不管发生什么事，老大都不希望更多的人知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen, your proposal was wonderful, yet no matter what happens, our boss never wants outsiders to know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "听你们老大的吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Follow your boss's wishes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我不明白，为什么老大能救我们一百次，而我们连一次都救不了他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just don't understand why our boss can rescue us a hundred times while we can't save him even once.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "签个字，这是下一期闻娱论，我要让洛琳上这个节目跟她好好聊一聊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "凭着我五千个小时的主播生涯，我一定让这个满嘴谎话的女人当场现出原形！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你回来！现在不行，不要把这些事情扩大。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你就愿意顶着这身脏水被黑一辈子？你还有没有原则了，你怕什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你听我说，不能让这件事情再扩大，不要再去翻这些旧账。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻思默，我求你了行吗？我不是真的不能面对过去，那些陈年烂事可以挖。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是我拜托你不要是现在，不要是我跟惠美的这个时候，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我越界了。事关你们的私事，应该你们自己去处理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你和惠美的个性都很强，我相信你们自己能处理好。记得吃药。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "闻老师，您提的这个建议特别好，但是不管发生什么事，老大都不希望更多的人知道。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "听你们老大的吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我不明白，为什么老大能救我们一百次，而我们连一次都救不了他。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Realizing Yuqiao is begging solely to shield his fragile relationship with Xin Huimei, Wen Simo backs down and reminds him to take his stomach medicine—leaving Xingzi heartbroken that they cannot rescue their boss even once. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
